            -> Table scan on t1  (cost=0.21 rows=6)
            -> Hash
                -> Filter: (t2.a > 1)  (cost=0.75 rows=2)
                    -> Table scan on t2  (cost=0.75 rows=5)
        -> Select #2 (subquery in condition; dependent)
            -> Aggregate: avg(t2.c)  (cost=0.78 rows=1)
                -> Filter: ((t1.a = t2.c) and (t1.a = t2.a) and (t1.b = t2.b) and (t2.a > 1))  (cost=0.68 rows=1)
                    -> Table scan on t2  (cost=0.68 rows=5)

Warnings:
Note	1276	Field or reference 'tpch.t1.a' of SELECT #2 was resolved in SELECT #1
Note	1276	Field or reference 'tpch.t1.a' of SELECT #2 was resolved in SELECT #1
